  "description": "The GoZip Foldable Electric Kids Scooter is a lightweight and practical option for short trips and recreational riding. Powered by a 150W brushless motor, it delivers smooth acceleration, reaches speeds of up to 10 MPH, and offers up to 40 minutes of ride time per charge. Its 24V lithium battery fully recharges in approximately one to two hours, helping minimize downtime between rides.\nBuilt with a durable steel frame, the scooter weighs only 11 lbs and supports riders up to 154 lbs. Its foldable design makes it easy to carry, transport, and store when not in use. Additional features include 6.5-inch solid tires, an ABS braking system, throttle-powered operation, an integrated horn, an LED display showing speed, battery level, and light status, fenders, a kickstand, and IPX4 water resistance. Finished in blue, this compact kids electric scooter combines portability, convenience, and dependable everyday performance.\n\n10mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 40 min. ride time\n\n150 WHub Motor\n\n24V",
